crdt333 — 333 P2P OS L5 State layer
=====================================

This crate provides CRDT types (Crdt/AutoCrdt trait + Lww, LwwMap, Map,
Bool, Deletable) for eventual-consistency state synchronization.

Attribution
-----------
The API surface and type names are inspired by the `garage::util::crdt`
module of Garage (https://git.deuxfleurs.fr/Deuxfleurs/garage, AGPL-3.0).
The CRDT merge mathematics is textbook (see Shapiro et al., "Conflict-free
Replicated Data Types", 2011) and not copyrightable.

This crate was written clean-room based on the CRDT specification. It does
not contain source code copied from Garage and is licensed under
Apache-2.0 OR MIT.
